# ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
# VLESS — build-time API keys (OPTIONAL)
#
# Copy this file to `.env` and fill in ONE key to wire a cloud planner.
# WXT compiles WXT_* vars into the extension at BUILD time, so after
# editing you must rebuild:   npm run build
#
# A key entered in the extension's Provider Settings tab (encrypted,
# per-device, never written into the bundle) always OVERRIDES anything
# here and is the right choice for a shared or published build. These
# build-time keys are for a local demo machine only — they are readable
# in the built bundle.
#
# You only need ONE. Claude is the project default (planningPriority
# leads with Claude), and cloud is preferred over local Ollama the
# moment any key below is set.
# ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────

# Anthropic Claude — default provider (model: claude-3-5-haiku-20241022)
# Get a key: https://console.anthropic.com/settings/keys
WXT_ANTHROPIC_API_KEY=

# OpenAI (GPT) — model: gpt-4o-mini
# Get a key: https://platform.openai.com/api-keys
WXT_OPENAI_API_KEY=

# OpenRouter — one key, many models (model: openai/gpt-4o-mini)
# Get a key: https://openrouter.ai/keys
WXT_OPENROUTER_API_KEY=
